v 3
d 'PLUMBMETA': module to create a variable-level metadata snapshot of a dataset
d
d plumbmeta describes the data in memory or a dataset on disk as one row
d per variable: position, name, storage type, format, variable label,
d value label (and whether it is defined), non-missing, system-missing and
d extended-missing counts, and optionally distinct count, minimum and
d maximum. Export to .dta or TSV for data dictionaries and preservation.
d
d KW: data management
d KW: metadata
d KW: codebook
d KW: data dictionary
d
d Requires: Stata version 14
d
d Author: Brian W. Mandikiana, SESRI, Qatar University
d Support: email bwmandikiana@gmail.com
d Support: https://github.com/codeatcodecto/plumber/issues
d License: MIT
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261126
d
f plumbmeta.ado
f plumbmeta.sthlp
